# DKC3 adaptations of the pinned snesrecomp scalar PPU. Applied by
# scripts/apply_dkc3_runtime_patches.py to a build-directory copy; the
# submodule is untouched. Every anchor must match exactly once (or the
# stated count) or the configure step fails.
file: runner/src/snes/ppu.c

# Mode 2, front to back: OBJ3 BG1H OBJ2 BG2H OBJ1 BG1L OBJ0 BG2L. OBJ retains
# the runtime's priorities 14/10/6/2; BG priorities fit between them.
