# A full 8-pixel tile row of a 4bpp layer is stored with one vector
# operation on NEON (Apple silicon) or SSE2 (x86-64): the eight nibbles
# become lanes, the opacity, priority and viewport tests become lane
# masks, and a blend writes the row. Every lane applies exactly the
# scalar DO_PIXEL rule. Other targets keep the scalar sequence.
